==Chapters==
* Chapter 1: [[DPA14|A Novel Test!!]]
* Chapter 2: [[DPA15|An Enormous Power Awakens!]]
* Chapter 3: [[DPA16|Team Galactic's Ultimate Warrior]]
* Chapter 4: [[DPA17|Clash! Hareta vs. Mitsumi!!]]
* Special Chapter: [[DPAS3|The Tale of Hareta and Shaymin]]

==Important events==
* Mitsumi is blackmailed into rejoining Team Galactic.
* Hareta defeats Candice and captures Regigigas.
* Hareta and the Gym Leaders storm Galactic HQ.
* Hareta comes up in a battle against Mitsumi.

==Party changes==
===Additions===
The following Pokémon are obtained:
* Hareta's {{TP|Hareta|Regigigas}} in [[DPA15]]
* Hareta's {{p|Bonsly}} prior to [[DPA16]]
* Hareta's {{p|Kadabra}} prior to [[DPA16]]

===Evolutions===
The following Pokémon evolve:
* Hareta's {{p|Riolu}} to {{p|Lucario}} in [[DPA14]]

==Gym Battles==
Hareta defeats the following Gym Leaders:
* [[Candice]] in [[DPA14]]

